    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can snatch victory from the jaws of defeat when involved in a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenge\">Skill Challenge</a>.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenge\">Skill Challenge</a>, you treat the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenge\">Skill Challenge</a> as if it had the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Recovery_(Challenge_Effect)\" title=\"Recovery (Challenge Effect)\">Recovery</a> effect, even if it does not have that effect.</p><p><b>Special:</b> This Feat is allowed only in campaigns that use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Challenges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Challenges\">Skill Challenges</a>.</p>",
